WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:06.440
Please, Commander Liu order the volunteers to prepare an assault on the Wuzhao camp those unwilling to fight.

00:06.520 --> 00:09.640
Are spies isn't this a bit arbitrary?

00:12.640 --> 00:18.067
If they don't dare fight the Wuzhao then these people why would they want to enter the city?

00:19.760 --> 00:21.160
I understand.

00:29.000 --> 00:30.400
What do you mean?

00:30.640 --> 00:37.107
First you won't let us in now you want us to be the vanguard to die damn it I won't take this insult.

00:37.920 --> 00:43.600
We brothers rushed here to fight the Wuzhao old Liu don't try to smooth things over.

00:43.680 --> 00:49.240
Those bastards in Yiyang I'm done serving them let's go go you.

00:49.760 --> 00:51.160
Go.

00:55.400 --> 00:56.800
Your Highness.

00:57.960 --> 01:01.320
Those unwilling to fight have all left with their men.

01:02.320 --> 01:06.520
The remaining follow me into the city yes.

